{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L5zaZxzcc23E6wyM1UCKQc","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# solver-trace-ablation — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 09:06 UTC | 更新原因: D038 taxonomy 结果纳入 + 刷新 RUNNING 状态（plan016 已完成、s43/s44 在跑）\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nSTA/ISR 作为 GRPO neurosymbolic formalizer 的**诊断工具** + **Goodhart's Law 案例研究**——检测 reward hacking、量化结构退化、分类退化模式，并展示 ISR 从诊断指标到优化目标的 Goodhart 转折。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research + 审稿进行中 | **DDL**: 2026-05-25（剩 11 天）\\\\n- **实验**: 39 个 (RUNNING 2, PREPARING 5, DONE 32) | success 8\\\\n- **GPU**: 2 × RTX PRO 6000 96GB — ✅ 两卡满载\\\\n\\\\n### 核心证据链\\\\n- ✅ ISR 崩塌轨迹：0.6423 (100步) → 0.1324 (500步) → 0.0027 (1000步)\\\\n- ✅ 3-seed exec-only：s42 conclusion embedding | s43 degraded | s44 tautological collapse\\\\n- ✅ Goodhart β 剂量效应：β=0.1 sweet spot (ISR 3.2x > random) vs β=0.3 collapse (ISR < random)\\\\n- ✅ Hacking taxonomy 定量对比 (D038)：ISR β=0.1 genuine 25.9% vs random 17.7% (+8.2pp)，conclusion embedding 73-79%\\\\n- ✅ plan016 1000步：PR=0.96, ISR=0.003，崩塌持续恶化\\\\n- ✅ plan014 downstream NLI: ISR-NLI ρ=-0.049 n.s.，ISR 能力边界已刻画\\\\n- ✅ Table 1 修复 + 文献修正完成\\\\n- ⏳ plan002-b01-s43/s44: RUNNING — β=0.1 多 seed 验证\\\\n- 🔜 plan018-random-s43/s44: PREPARING — matched random 多 seed 控制\\\\n- 🔜 plan006-prolog ×3: PREPARING — Claim 3 跨 logic type 验证\\\\n\\\\n## RUNNING\\\\n| 实验 | GPU | 说明 |\\\\n|------|-----|------|\\\\n| plan002-additive-b01-s43 | cuda:0 | ISR β=0.1 seed=43 |\\\\n| plan002-additive-b01-s44 | cuda:1 | ISR β=0.1 seed=44 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] s43/s44 完成 → eval_sta.py + taxonomy + 3-seed mean±std\\\\n- [ ] plan018-random-s43/s44 启动（GPU 空闲后）\\\\n- [ ] plan006 Prolog 代码/数据 readiness 确认\\\\n- [ ] 3-seed 全部出齐 → Table 1 + Table 2 定稿\\\\n- [ ] plan006 结果 → 论文写作启动评估\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 本地: 2 × RTX PRO 6000 96GB，两卡满载\\\\n- 已消耗: ~35+ GPU·h\\\\n- 剩余需求: ~12h（s43/s44 ~2h + random s43/s44 ~2h + plan006 ×3 ~6h + eval ~2h）\\\\n- DDL 11 天 × 2 卡 × 24h = 528 GPU·h，时间充裕\\\\n\\\\n## 写作约束\\\\n- plan013 vs plan017 公式结构不同，不可简化为\\\\\\\"additive vs convex\\\\\\\"对照 (D027)\\\\n- ISR β=0.1 hacking rate 仍达 74%——论文不可标\\\\\\\"no hacking\\\\\\\"，应标\\\\\\\"lowest hacking rate\\\\\\\" (D038)\\\\n- β=0.1 3-seed 出齐前论文统计用 s42 单 seed，标注 preliminary\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D043 | 2026-05-14 | ISR β=0.1 \\\\\\\"sweet spot\\\\\\\"叙事降级：2/3 seeds ISR 膨胀为 artif | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan002-additive-b01-s43, plan002-additive-b01-s44, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D042 | 2026-05-14 | ISR 度量存在结构性盲点：premise≈conclusion 时 conclusion sub- | plan002-additive-b01-s43, plan002-additive-b01-s44, plan002-additive-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D041 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 framing pivot: ISR β=0.1 \\\\\\\"sweet spot\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"a | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan002-additive-b01-s43, plan002-additive-b01-s44 |\\\\n| D040 | 2026-05-14 | plan002-b01-s44 reclassified: \\\\\\\"success\\\\\\\" → \\\\\\\"new hac | plan002-additive-b01-s44, plan002-additive-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D039 | 2026-05-14 | plan002-b01-s44 重分类：从 success 改为 semantic drift ha | plan002-additive-b01-s44 |\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-14 | Hacking taxonomy 结果足够，跳过 LLM-as-judge；taxonomy 对比覆 | plan012, plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-14 | ISR β=0.1 质量验证路径：先 hacking taxonomy 对比，必要时加 LLM-as | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan012 |\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-14 | 为 beta=0.1 补跑多 seed (s43/s44) 验证 ISR vs random 的稳健 | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan001-exec-only-s43 |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-14 | Framing 选 C: Goodhart 主线 — ISR 展示经典 Goodhart 效应（β= | plan002-b01, plan018, plan002-b03, plan017 |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-14 | Framing 选 C+A 混合：Goodhart 为主线叙事，ISR 诊断保留为 C