\\\\n    plan014 downstream validation 补盲区\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现 ISR 反直觉行为：plan013 P→P 纯重言式 ISR=0.5 > plan001 多前提嵌入 conclusion\\\\n    ISR≈0。从语义忠实度看 P→P 更差（完全忽略 context），但 ISR 定义下反而更高，因为 ISR=n_necessary/n_components，极简\\\\n    formalization 的分母小。论文不能将 ISR 差异直接等同于 formalization 质量差异——需明确 ISR 的 scope 是 component\\\\n    necessity。plan014 downstream NLI validation 直接测量 semantic faithfulness，弥补 ISR\\\\n    盲区。同时建议考虑组合指标（ISR + non-tautological check + 最小组件数阈值）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: P→P tautology ISR=0.5, 语义完全退化但ISR不低\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 多前提嵌入conclusion ISR≈0, 语义更好但ISR更低\\\\n  - exp_id: plan014\\\\n    role: mitigation\\\\n    result: downstream NLI validation 补充语义忠实度测量\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 03:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan002 additive ISR β=0.3 负面结果确认：PR=18% + ISR=0.1427，ISR reward 作为训练信号的路线全面失败，论文转向纯诊断/分析贡献\\\\n  rationale: 'plan002 held-out eval: PR=18%（最差）, ISR=0.1427≈exec-only 0.1324。加上 plan005\\\\n    (convex, negative) 和 plan013 (random, tautological hacking)，所有 ISR-as-reward 方案均失败。但三个条件产生了三种不同的退化模式（conclusion\\\\n    embedding / P→P tautology / repetitive cycling），这本身是有价值的研究发现。论文应完全放弃\\\\\\\"ISR reward\\\\n    改善训练\\\\\\\"的 claim，转向：(1) STA/ISR 作为诊断工具检测 reward hacking (2) GRPO saturation 机制分析 (3)\\\\n    不同 reward 信号下的 hacking 策略分类学 (4) ISR 随训练的崩塌轨迹。plan014 downstream validation 成为证明\\\\n    ISR 诊断价值的关键实验。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: PR=18%, ISR=0.1427, 重复前提循环退化'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan005-sta-low-s42\\\\n    role: prior_negative\\\\n    result: convex combination penalty effect\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 100% tautological hacking, ISR=0.5 假象\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: PR=93%, ISR=0.132, conclusion embedding\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D019\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:28 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan014 ISR-accuracy 假说被否定；ISR 定位为 syntactic necessity 指标，不 claim semantic\\\\n    quality proxy\\\\n  rationale: Spearman ρ(ISR, entailment_accuracy) = -0.049, p=0.187（n=732），ISR-based\\\\n    BoN Δ=0.88pp CI含零。同时发现系统性 true 偏差（gold=true 91.2% acc, gold=false 0%），说明 formalization\\\\n    pipeline 本身有 truth bias。ISR 衡量组件必要性（去掉后证明是否成立），不衡量 formalization 是否语义忠实。论文应明确此\\\\n    limitation，将 plan014 作为 negative result 诚实报告，刻画 ISR 能力边界。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan014-downstream-nli-s42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: negative — ISR与下游NLI准确率无显著相关\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D022\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:30 UTC\\\\n  summary: 选备选 A：ISR downstream 验证降级为 limitation/future work，不追加 NLI 替代实验\\\\n  rationale: ISR 结构价值已有 component count 差异（p<0.0001）和 cross-checkpoint 对比强证据。NLI negative\\\\n    源于 formalization model 的 true-bias（非 ISR 本身缺陷），换 downstream 任务（B）在同一 model 上大概率复现同样问题。n=12\\\\n    的 bucket 趋势（C）统计不可靠。聚焦 plan017 + s44 完成核心证据链。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan014-downstream-nli-s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D021\\\\n- id: D023\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: paper_framing.md 全量重写：4 条诊断/分析 claims 替代旧 2 条 reward methodology claims，与\\\\n    D020 pivot 一致\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: paper_framing.md 仍写 \\\\\\\"STA as Reward Design Methodology\\\\\\\"\\\\n    + additive bonus headline，但 D020 已确认 ISR-as-reward 全面失败。新 framing 4 条 claims:\\\\n    (1) ISR as hacking diagnostic (ISR 崩塌轨迹), (2) GRPO saturation mechanism, (3) hacking\\\\n    taxonomy (4 种模式), (4) ISR capability boundary (syntactic necessity ≠ semantic\\\\n    faithfulness)。Story spine 从 \\\\\\\"propose structural reward\\\\\\\" 转为 \\\\\\\"diagnostic tool +\\\\n    systematic empirical study of reward hacking\\\\\\\"。负面结果表（convex/additive/random）作为正面贡献呈现。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: negative_evidence\\\\n    result: PR=18%, ISR=0.14, repetitive cycling\\\\n  - exp_id: plan005-sta-low-s42\\\\n    role: negative_evidence\\\\n    result: convex penalty effect confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: negative_evidence\\\\n    result: 100% tautological, ISR=0.5 mechanical\\\\n  - exp_id: plan014-downstream-nli-s42\\\\n    role: negative_evidence\\\\n    result: ρ=-0.049 n.s., ISR ≠ semantic quality\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: core_evidence\\\\n    result: ISR collapse 64%→13%, hacking detected\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D021\\\\n  - D022\\\\n- id: D024\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:32 UTC\\\\n  summary: 批准 plan006 Prolog GRPO 执行，3 seeds，强化跨 logic type 泛化性（原 P1 提升为紧急）\\\\n  rationale: 诊断/分析论文如果只有 FOL 一种逻辑类型，venue 风险高（可能降至 Findings）。plan006 Prolog 验证 hacking\\\\n    现象是否跨 logic type 泛化，6 GPU·h 成本低（vs 528 GPU·h 可用）。Reviewer 明确指出 generalizability\\\\n    是论文能否进 Main 的关键因素。先跑 exec-only seed=42 验证方向，成功再 3-seed。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan006\\\\n    role: planned\\\\n    result: Prolog GRPO exec-only vs exec+STA, 3 seeds\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D025\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan017 确认 ISR 作为 reward 比 random noise 更差：additive random PR=48% > additive\\\\n    ISR PR=18%。ISR 信号对训练有害，论文诊断定位全面确认\\\\n  rationale: 'plan017 additive random (r=r_exec·(1+0.3·random)) held-out eval: PR=48%,\\\\n    ISR=0.045, components=9.56。对比 plan002 additive ISR (PR=18%, ISR=0.026, components=10.67)，random\\\\n    noise 在相同公式结构下 PR 高 2.7 倍。关键洞察：(1) ISR 结构信号对 GRPO 训练有害而非无用；(2) additive 乘法结构本身防止\\\\n    tautological collapse（两者 components 9-10 vs plan013 的 2.04）；(3) 但 additive 结构也无法产生\\\\n    genuine proofs（PR 远低于 exec-only s42 的 93%）。六组实验全景完整：exec-only 是唯一产生 genuine proofs\\\\n    的方案（1/3 seeds），ISR 应定位为 post-hoc diagnostic，非 training signal。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan017-additive-random-s42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: PR=48%, ISR=0.045, components=9.56, complex-but-useless'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 'negative: PR=18%, ISR=0.026, ISR worse than random'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: PR=100% but 100% tautological, components=2.04\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: PR=93%, ISR=0.123, only genuine proofs (1/3 seeds)\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D018\\\\n- id: D026\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:34 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan017 确认 ISR 作为训练信号比 random noise 更差（PR 18% vs 48%），ISR 信号对 GRPO 训练有害，完全确立\\\\n    diagnostic-only 定位\\\\n  rationale: 'plan017 additive random (r=r_exec·(1+0.3·random)) eval_sta: PR=48%,\\\\n    ISR=0.045, components=9.56。对比 plan002 additive ISR (β=0.3): PR=18%, ISR=0.026,\\\\n    components=10.67。ISR 结构信号不仅无法改善训练，反而比 random noise 更差——ISR 信号对训练动态有害。两个 additive\\\\n    方案都保持高 component count（9-10），说明乘法结构 r_exec·(1+βX) 本身防止 tautological collapse，但不产生\\\\n    genuine proofs。Exec-only (s42) 仍是唯一产生 genuine proofs 的方案（PR=93%），但 2/3 seeds 失败。论文六组实验消融完整，强化\\\\n    ISR diagnostic-only 定位：ISR 应用于 post-hoc 诊断而非 reward shaping。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan017-additive-random-s42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: PR=48%, ISR=0.045, complex-but-useless formalization'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 'negative: PR=18%, ISR=0.026, ISR worse than random'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan001-exec-only-s42-r2\\\\n    role: baseline\\\\n    result: 'success: PR=93%, ISR=0.132, only genuine proofs'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r4\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 'tautological: PR=100%, ISR=0.535, P→P collapse'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D027\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: 采纳备选 A+B：plan017 加入 Claim 2 证据 + Claim 3 增加第 5 种 hacking mode \\\\\\\"complexity-without-utility\\\\\\\"；Reviewer\\\\n    关于 plan013 vs plan017 公式差异的 warning 纳入写作约束\\\\n  rationale: 'plan017 结果完善了六组消融对比。备选 A 将 plan017 加入 Claim 2（GRPO 对 reward perturbation\\\\n    敏感）是必须的数据更新。备选 B 增加第 5 种 hacking mode（complexity-without-utility: 高 component\\\\n    但 conclusion 不依赖任何 premise）丰富 taxonomy，区别于 exec-only 的 conclusion embedding。Reviewer\\\\n    指出 plan013 (0.9·r_exec+0.1·random) vs plan017 (r_exec·(1+0.3·random)) 不是纯 additive\\\\n    vs convex 对照（公式结构+random 影响方式两个变量），论文措辞需精确标注差异，不可简化为\\\\\\\"additive vs convex\\\\\\\"。plan017\\\\n    vs plan002 的对比（random PR=48% vs ISR PR=18%）作为论文 §5 核心证据。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan017-additive-random-s42\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: 'negative: PR=48%, complexity-without-utility mode'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: 'ISR worse than random: PR=18% vs 48%'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D026\\\\n  - D020\\\\n- id: D028\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:35 UTC\\\\n  summary: paper_framing.md 全面重写：3 条诊断/分析 claims 替代旧 2 条 method claims，与 D020 pivot\\\\n    一致\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer CRITICAL: paper_framing.md 仍写 \\\\\\\"STA as Reward Design Methodology\\\\\\\"\\\\n    + additive bonus headline，与 D020 pivot 严重矛盾。重写为 3 条诊断 claims: (1) ISR as hacking\\\\n    diagnostic (ISR 崩塌轨迹), (2) GRPO saturation mechanism (variance redirection), (3)\\\\n    cross-logic generality (conditional on plan006)。Story spine 从 \\\\\\\"ISR improves training\\\\\\\"\\\\n    转为 \\\\\\\"ISR detects hacking + 4 hacking modes + saturation trap\\\\\\\"。ISR-as-reward failure\\\\n    log 保留所有 negative results 作为论文贡献。Headline result 更新为诊断发现而非方法改进。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan002-additive-b03-s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'negative: PR=18%, ISR=0.1427'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan005-sta-low-s42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'negative: convex penalty'\\\\n  - exp_id: plan013-random-reward-s42-r