{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013NToSYgpbUMKyv4QRjfJeB","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| plan006-prolog-sta-s42 | Prolog exec+STA GRPO seed=42: ISR reward 在 Prolog logic type 上的效果。与 plan006-prolog-exec-s42 (exec-only) 对照，验证 STA/ISR 的 hacking 检测和 Goodhart 效应是否跨 logic type 泛化。 | — | — | — |\\\\n| plan006-prolog-exec-s42 | Prolog exec-only GRPO seed=42: STA/ISR hacking patterns generalize across logic types? Prolog uses rule ablation (vs FOL axiom ablation). If same degeneration modes appear → STA is logic-agnostic diagnostic. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- plan018-additive-random-b01-s43: Random β=0.1 seed=43 控制组：与 plan002-b01-s43 (ISR β=0.1) 同 seed 对照。验证 ISR 3.2x > random 的结论在 s43 下是否成立。（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- plan018-additive-random-b01-s44: Random β=0.1 seed=44 控制组：与 plan002-b01-s44 (ISR β=0.1) 同 seed 对照。验证 ISR 3.2x > random 的结论在 s44 下是否成立。（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- plan006-prolog-sta-s44: Prolog exec+STA GRPO seed=44: 第三 seed。3-seed mean±std 用于论文 Claim 3 跨 logic type 统计支撑。（准备中）\\\\n- plan006-prolog-sta-s43: Prolog exec+STA GRPO seed=43: 跨 seed 稳定性检查。与 exec-only s43 对照。（准备中）\\\\n- plan006-prolog-exec-s44: Prolog exec-only GRPO seed=44: third seed for Prolog. Together with s42/s43, provides 3-seed evidence for cross-logic generalization claim.（准备中）\\\\n- plan006-prolog-exec-s43: Prolog exec-only GRPO seed=43: cross-seed stability check for Prolog logic type. FOL showed extreme cross-seed variance (s42 genuine vs s43 degenerate vs s44 tautological).（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **plan002-additive-b01-s43** (negative): ISR β=0.1 seed=43 多 seed 验证：plan002-b01-s42 (PR=0.81, ISR=0.337) 在 s43 下是否可复现？exec-only s43 是 degraded seed (PR=14%)，ISR β=0.1 能否拯救 bad seed？3-seed mean±std 用于论文 Claim 2 统计支撑。 ← 基于 plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n  [plan002-b01-s43-eval-results](/api/workspace-files/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/plan002-additive-b01-s43/data/plan002-b01-s43-eval-pointer.txt)\\\\n- **plan002-additive-b01-s44** (negative): ISR β=0.1 seed=44 多 seed 验证：exec-only s44 是 tautological collapse (PR=98%, ISR=0.57 fake)，ISR β=0.1 能否防止 tautological collapse？3-seed mean±std 用于论文 Claim 2。 ← 基于 plan002-additive-b01-s42\\\\n- **plan012-hacking-taxonomy** (success): ISR β=0.1 vs Random β=0.1 hacking taxonomy 对比：ISR reward 能否减少 hacking 模式比例、增加 genuine proof 比例？5 种 hacking 分类（conclusion embedding, repetition collapse, tautological collapse, complexity-without-utility, premise padding）。\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 9 / 负向 12 / 失败 14 / 共 35\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-39279: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-only-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- sta-phase1-exec-sta-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s42-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43-r2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan013-random-reward-s42-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan001-exec-only-s43-r3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3095, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01DtzZHvZvJXZnJ3iY3VYNZc","session_id":"89cdeb8e-ead5-4a30-afa3-c65e0c614ccf","uuid":"dcacd705-05ac-49d8-88c4-d8adde8878cd","timestamp":"2026-05-14T10:17:48.100Z"}
